 terminals and reduced shipments to steel manufacturing locations, partially offset by higher shipments to utility plants. *Trucking Revenue* Trucking revenue decreased $13 million versus the prior year due to lower rates and fuel surcharge. *Other Revenue* Other revenue decreased $28 million primarily due to 2024 revenue including payments from customers that did not meet volume commitments. Table of Contents CSX CORPORATION", "remarks": ["Forest products volume declined 4%, reflecting an uncertain building products environment when considering interest rates and changing trading policies."]}

