ustomers, could adversely affect our business, operating results and financial condition.\nIn addition, we and our competitors may acquire businesses and technologies to complement and expand our respective product offerings.", "remarks": ["We also saw significant customer pull for HAPS, including at a large U.S. mobile company, which deployed multi-die designs on HAPS and reduced bring up time by approximately 40%."]}

